Eh? Two original songs? Eh? Did Todoroki Hajime even have that many?

681
00:52:49,114 --> 00:52:53,514
カウンタック、そして、新曲がでます！
Countach, and... a new song is coming!

682
00:52:53,614 --> 00:53:00,014
