Please listen to these two songs back-to-back. Well then, here is "Countach".

683
00:53:26,114 --> 00:53:30,414
何のために頑張るの？ 報われないって言ったって
What am I working so hard for? Even if they say it won't pay off,

684
00:53:30,514 --> 00:53:34,814
結局、正直者が 道化師（ピエロ）で踊る残像
in the end, it's just an afterimage of the honest person dancing like a clown.

685
