どうにかなりやがっちゃってキャラ
somehow managing with this character...

733
00:57:14,322 --> 00:57:15,822
歓声はノー
the cheers are nonexistent,

734
00:57:15,822 --> 00:57:18,322
だっての
that's how it is.

735
00:57:18,622 --> 00:57:20,822
愛にもたれた言葉で心拍数
My heart rate goes up from words leaning on love,

736
00:57:20,822 --> 00:57:22,822
生きてく程胸は沈んでく
the more I live, the heavier my chest sinks.

737
00:57:22,822 --> 00:57:24,322
どうしてんだろうな？
What's going on with me?

738
00:57:24,322 --> 00:57:25,822
この脳が揺れるの
My brain is shaking...

739
00:57:25,822 --> 00:57:27,822
かいつまんでもしょうがねぇ
There's no point in summarizing it,

740
00:57:27,822 --> 00:57:29,822
汗かき稼ぐお金はどんだけ？
how much money do I even make sweating away?

741
00:57:29,822 --> 00:57:31,022
ああだこうだ
