766
00:58:59,322 --> 00:59:02,322
バンザイ 無能な命に
Banzai to this incompetent life!

767
00:59:02,322 --> 00:59:06,822
から回ってく脳を満たしてくれ
Fill up my brain that's spinning out of control!

768
00:59:06,822 --> 00:59:10,822
未来予想図なんか描けない
I can't draw any vision of the future,

769
